{"id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-vardom.md","title":"Boolean variable domain","display":"df-vardom — Boolean variable domain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-vardom","aliases":["27-df-vardom"],"display":"df-vardom — Boolean variable domain","depends_on":["[[27-df-bool]]","[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.1 Definition 1.1; §1.8 Definition 1.22","source_printed_pages":"4, 28","source_pdf_pages":"28, 52","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-with-local-zero-arity-extension"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-vardom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-vardom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vardom — Boolean variable domain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Definition 1.1; §1.8 Definition 1.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"4, 28"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"28, 52"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-with-local-zero-arity-extension"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[n]\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid1\\leq i\\leq n\\},\\qquad \\mathbb B^n\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{[n]},\\qquad \\mathbb B^0=\\{\\emptyset\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[n]\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid1\\leq i\\leq n\\},\\qquad \\mathbb B^n\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{[n]},\\qquad \\mathbb B^0=\\{\\emptyset\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 1.1 以正元数陈述；本目录显式允许零元数，使 Definition 1.22 的单变量限制与递归终点闭合。零元数是本地保守扩展，不能误记为原书额外定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbb B$ 见 [[27-df-bool]]，$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[27-df-nat]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbb B$ 见 [[27-df-bool]]，$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[27-df-nat]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid1\\leq i\\leq n\\},\\qquad \\mathbb B^n\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{[n]},\\qquad \\mathbb B^0=\\{\\emptyset\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1169,"backlinks":[{"id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathbb B^n$ 见 [[27-df-vardom]]；函数以其集合论图表示。"},{"id":"5cf2cdaf54dc651b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb{B}^{n}$ (Boolean vectors, see [[27-df-vardom]])"},{"id":"0941fdc1df502e5c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n],\\mathbb B$ 见 [[27-df-vardom]]；有限标量合取、析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。有限序列以函数编码；$\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$、$\\epsilon$、$\\preceq$、$u^\\frown j$ 由下式定义。$T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$ 非空有限，且 $\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\;(v\\subseteq u\\Rightarrow v\\in T)$。$V\\subseteq[n]$ 非空；$L_T,I_T,c_T$ 由下式定义，$\\lambda:I_T\\to\\mathbb B$、$\\ell:L_T\\to V$。本节引入谓词 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$；$E_T,\\Gamma_T$ 仅在该谓词成立时定义，$\\Gamma_T$ 的顶点集为 $V$。另引入函数族 $(A_u:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B)_{u\\in T}$。"},{"id":"b88c7891742923e3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb{Z}_{>0}$ and $\\mathbb{B}^{n}$ (see [[27-df-vardom]])"},{"id":"58aefeb09654b757","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbb B^n$、$[n]$ 见 [[27-df-vardom]]，$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]。投影文字与补文字仅对 $i\\in[n]$ 构造；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n$、$\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$ 对每个 $n\\in\\mathbb N$ 构造。"},{"id":"c37db3f5d9a525b7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}$ (Boolean vectors, see [[27-df-vardom]])"},{"id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathbb B^n=\\mathbb B^{[n]}$，见 [[27-df-vardom]]。"},{"id":"f81148ddb9a8ee2f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。"},{"id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $\\mathbb B^n=\\{0,1\\}^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}$（see [[27-df-vardom]]），$\\mathbb R$（see [[27-df-real]]）。"},{"id":"e4a21ca3b3930018","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。"},{"id":"3079644762048cc1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。"},{"id":"84fb6d5dede03600","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。"},{"id":"4cce6c7a39335fa2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-361","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom|df-vardom — Boolean variable domain]]"}],"outgoing":["1da79f596b2671f9","d87d01e5686c19fe"]}